# AI provider adapter

Default integration is Open WebUI via the OpenAI-compatible adapter
(`AI_PROVIDER=openai_compatible`). `mock` remains the offline/dev default.

Six model roles are assigned independently: orchestrator, triage, extraction,
qc, synthesis, embeddings. A role may point at a discovered model id; it
must not assume a single global model.

Test Connection and model discovery use a tiny synthetic ping. Never attach
matter documents or review-table text to those calls.

Prompt versions are immutable once saved; edits create a new version so
column runs retain lineage.
